    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking for some advice on stacking pallets for our high-density racking in rotterdam. we're dealing with some really heavy loads and i'm worried about stability when we're going high up. what's the best way to handle the stacking patterns to keep things from tipping?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
